WEBVTT

NOTE Supplier review — Fernleaf Garden Supply and Greenway Growers

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Rosa Delgado>Thanks for making time, Tom. I wanted to go over the spring and summer deliveries.</v>

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Tom Whitfield>Of course. I know April and May were better than March.</v>

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Tom Whitfield>The fixed Tuesday slot has helped our drivers a lot.</v>

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Sam Okafor>Every delivery since the start of April has arrived on the Tuesday, which is great for us.</v>

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.000
<v Rosa Delgado>So we have agreed to keep Greenway Growers as our main plant supplier for next year.</v>

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Tom Whitfield>Thank you. For next season I can offer 4% off if you commit to a standing weekly order.</v>

7
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:03.000
<v Rosa Delgado>We will take the 4% on a standing order from March to June, reviewed every month.</v>

8
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
<v Sam Okafor>I will send Tom the standing order list by 1 October.</v>

9
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
<v Tom Whitfield>And I will send the updated price list for autumn bulbs by Friday.</v>

10
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
<v Rosa Delgado>Great. We will drop the Riverbend Nursery trial then.</v>
